# Avatar generation intermediates. The three sprites the code actually
# references are tracked; the ~28MB of candidate iterations that produced them
# are not. They are selection artifacts, and this repository is public, so
# committing them would put them in history permanently for no runtime benefit.
# See assets/avatar/README.md.
assets/avatar/ghost_opt_*
assets/avatar/ghost_blob_0*
assets/avatar/ghost_blob_cut_*
assets/avatar/ghost_bunny_front_*
assets/avatar/ghost_blob_meshy*
assets/avatar/*.glb
